  "description": "Base / Home Port: Naples (Marina di Stabia), Italy\nOperating Area: Amalfi Coast, Sardinia, Pontine Islands, Tuscany, Sicily & Aeolian Islands, Liguria & Cinque Terre\n\nExperience luxury aboard the \"DANIDA'\" Sanlorenzo SX88. The revolutionary design of the SX88 features wide open spaces and large glass windows, creating a seamless connection between the interior and exterior, catering to the most discerning clients. The high, seaworthy bow gracefully slopes toward the stern, streamlining the yacht's profile while ensuring exceptional all-weather performance.\n\nThe main deck's fore area is equipped with a sofa, a coffee table, and an extended sunbathing surface, providing a relaxing and functional living space.\n\nThe stern area is equally impressive, boasting a \"beach club\" space that is five steps below the main deck. This 30 sq. m area is shaded by parasols and furnished to perfection, offering a luxurious spot to enjoy life at the water’s edge. It also provides ample room for a variety of water toys, enhancing your on-water experience.\n\nBelow deck, the Sanlorenzo SX88 offers luxurious accommodations with four cabins: a Master cabin, a VIP cabin, and two Twin cabins, ensuring comfort for all guests.\n\nDANIDA’ is also serviced by a dedicated crew of four, ensuring an exceptional onboard experience.",
